.prose
  :markdown
    # RuboCop

    RuboCop is Ruby's linter, formatter, and static analyser in one tool, and
    it is the reason our code reviews are about design rather than commas.
    This guide covers installing it with the extensions we use, running it in
    the loops that matter (your editor, your terminal, CI), and — the core of
    it — the **baseline configuration** we recommend, including the cops we
    deliberately leave off and why.

